# Keys the action does not read are not reported.
# References: ADR-1100 D14.
# spec: kitty graphics protocol (sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol, read 2026-11-13), "Querying support for protocol features": "the other keys in the feature query are interpreted as they would be for that action"
# spec: ADR-1100 D14, "What the answer leaves out"
# covers: image.kitty
size 20 10
send "\e_Ga=q,i=38,e=t,U=1,C=1,c=3\e\\"
